h:42px;height:42px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.16);text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;font-size:20px;line-height:42px">&#128273;</td></tr></table></td></tr></table><h1 style="color:#ffffff;font-size:22px;margin:20px 0 0;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.01em;line-height:1.3">Reset Your Password</h1><p style="color:#a7f3d0;font-size:13.5px;margin:6px 0 0;font-weight:500">Choose a new password to get back in</p></td></tr><tr><td style="height:3px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#34d399,#059669,#047857);font-size:0;line-height:0">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td class="email-body" style="padding:36px 36px 8px"><p style="color:#374151;font-size:15px;margin:0 0 18px;line-height:1.6">Hi <strong>{{name}}</strong>,</p><p style="color:#374151;font-size:15px;margin:0 0 24px;line-height:1.6">We received a request to reset your password. Click the button below to choose a new one.</p><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:0 0 20px"><tr><td align="center"><a href="{{resetLink}}" style="display:inline-block;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#059669,#047857);color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;padding:14px 34px;border-radius:11px;font-weight:700;font-size:14.5px;box-shadow:0 4px 14px -2px rgba(5,150,105,0.45)">Reset Password &#8594;</a></td></tr></table><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#f9fafb;border-radius:10px;margin:0 0 22px"><tr><td style="padding:14px 18px"><p style="color:#6b7280;font-size:12.5px;margin:0 0 6px;font-weight:600">Button not working? Paste this link into your browser:</p><p style="font-size:12.5px;word-break:break-all;margin:0"><a href="{{resetLink}}" style="color:#059669">{{resetLink}}</a></p></td></tr></table><p style="color:#9ca3af;font-size:13px;margin:0;line-height:1.6">This link expires in 30 minutes. Did not request this? You can safely ignore this email.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:24px 36px 30px;border-top:1px solid #f1f5f9;background:#fafbfc"><p style="color:#9ca3af;font-size:12px;margin:0;line-height:1.7">This is an automated message from PortfoliosBuilder.</p><p style="color:#cbd5e1;font-size:10.5px;margin:10px 0 0;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.04em">PORTFOLIOSBUILDER — BUILD. SHOWCASE. GROW.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>'
