x;height:42px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.16);text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;font-size:20px;line-height:42px">&#128202;</td></tr></table></td></tr></table><h1 style="color:#ffffff;font-size:22px;margin:20px 0 0;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.01em;line-height:1.3">Your Weekly Snapshot</h1><p style="color:#a7f3d0;font-size:13.5px;margin:6px 0 0;font-weight:500">Here is what happened on your portfolio this week, {{fullName}}</p></td></tr><tr><td style="height:3px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#34d399,#059669,#047857);font-size:0;line-height:0">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td class="email-body" style="padding:36px 36px 8px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:0 0 26px"><tr><td width="48%" style="padding:20px 16px;text-align:center;background:#f9fafb;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #eef2f7"><p style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#059669;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 8px">Views</p><p style="font-size:32px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;margin:0">{{viewsThisWeek}}</p></td><td width="4%">&nbsp;</td><td width="48%" style="padding:20px 16px;text-align:center;background:#f9fafb;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #eef2f7"><p style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#059669;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 8px">Messages</p><p style="font-size:32px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;margin:0">{{newMessages}}</p></td></tr></table><p style="font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#9ca3af;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.06em;margin:0 0 10px">Top Traffic Sources</p><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border:1px solid #eef2f7;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden"><tr><td style="padding:10px 16px;background:#f9fafb;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#6b7280;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.04em;border-bottom:1px solid #eef2f7">Source</td><td style="padding:10px 16px;background:#f9fafb;font